Regulatory & Red Flag Targets: Search for product recalls, safety hazard alerts, injury or fatality reports, and enforcement actions from agencies such as the Consumer Product Safety Commission (CPSC), Food and Drug Administration (FDA), National Highway Traffic Safety Administration (NHTSA), Federal Trade Commission (FTC), Consumer Financial Protection Bureau (CFPB), or state attorneys general. Investigate major consumer fraud class-action lawsuits, deceptive contract terms, and forced arbitration clauses.